    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Independent type foundry founded 2018 by Mathieu (Mat) Desjardins in Montreal, ex ad agency art director; runs with a small globally remote team of collaborating type designers (roughly 4-5 per press coverage, matches Size 2-10). Known for the free-to-try licensing model (full glyph set free for personal use, commercial license purchased separately) and a large, widely used catalogue: Editorial New, Neue Montreal, Migra, Right Grotesk, Mori, Fragment, Monument, Frama, Kyoto, Neue Corp among others, broadly adopted across contemporary brand and editorial design. No dedicated LinkedIn company page found (only Mat Desjardins' personal profile, ca.linkedin.com/in/matdesjardins, Founder and Creative Director); leaving LinkedIn empty rather than attaching a person's profile to an org.",
